---
import { ASSESSMENT_HREF, WHATSAPP_HREF } from '../../lib/home';
---

<div class="not-prose mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-navy px-6 py-8 text-center text-white">
  <h2 class="font-heading mb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Need help understanding your options?</h2>
  <p class="mx-auto mb-6 max-w-lg text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">
    Reading a guide can help you understand the process, but every situation is different.
  </p>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
    <a href={ASSESSMENT_HREF} class="btn-primary !bg-gold !border-gold !text-navy-dark">Start My Assessment</a>
    <a href={WHATSAPP_HREF} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-whatsapp">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
  </div>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-xs text-white/50">
    We provide guidance and preparation support. Authorities make the final decisions.
  </p>
</div>
